§ `Arity three with no category anywhere`

ASSUME Person IS A TYPE

GIVEN p IS A Person
ASSUME `base rate` p IS A NUMBER

GIVEN a IS A NUMBER
      b IS A NUMBER
ASSUME `scaled by` a b IS A NUMBER

@export a probe
GIVEN p IS A Person
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `qualifies` p IF
    `scaled by` (`base rate` p) 2 AT LEAST 10
